      "y": -310,
      "width": 2250,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "# Maya · Adaptive monorepo development graph\n\nDesktop · Tablet · Mobile | BTC/USD + ETH/USD · Lynx public prices + local paper odds · Three.js · 10 bets → consultation → refresh for 10 more\n\nSix node plans × three planning QA passes, with scope-amendment rechecks; three sequential graph QA passes. Runtime QA is planned, not executed. [[Maya - Monorepo and Adaptive Layouts]]",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-loop",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 2250,
      "height": 205,
      "text": "## Every node: review → correct → recheck, three times\n\n1. Requirements and source evidence\n2. Boundaries, failures and interfaces\n3. Verify corrections and handoff\n\nDuring implementation, repeat three meaningful runtime QA rounds with captured evidence. Never convert a planning PASS into a runtime PASS.",
      "color": "3"
    },
